{"c":[{"id":"e2ebd6c0099fdfde","sum":"Push v2/* only to remote sam (SamGu-NRX/Caret); origin is the team hackathon repo. Ask intents use INTENT_ROUTE (gpt-oss-120b), plan programs WRITER_ROUTE (qwen3.8, ~1,000 output tokens/min, 200k/day on Groq); gpt-oss strict json_schema can 400.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261004T210855Z-22a0908ac8155d26","text":"Push v2/* branches to the remote named sam (SamGu-NRX/Caret), where their PRs live. origin is the team hackathon repo (theodorexli/hackathon-2026-09-19); a bare 'git push origin' publishes there.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261004T211051Z-2bd567d78f578d5c","text":"B25: Ask intents go to INTENT_ROUTE (gpt-oss-120b), plan programs to WRITER_ROUTE (qwen3.8); qwen3.8's Groq 200k tokens/day ran out during dev runs, and gpt-oss strict json_schema can 400 'does not match the expected schema'.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"b1d476e32a92cb95","sum":"B25: writers that space calls must give each request a fresh AbortSignal after the wait (a 15 s gap aborted every call); the job form marks required labels with U+2731, which realfill normLabel strips.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261004T211051Z-3925313f151b5275","text":"B25: eval writers that space calls must give the request a fresh AbortSignal after the wait; a 15 s gap aborted every intent in planner-eval's first GUI run.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261004T211051Z-9174d67891bff255","text":"B25: the job form marks required labels with U+2731; realfill normLabel strips it, and B24's scoreboards counted those four fields as not found.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]}
